%N A399101 Array read by antidiagonals: T(n,k) is the number of independent vertex sets in the n X k Klein bottle graph.
%C A399101 The twist is in the horizontal direction and the cycle in the vertical direction.
%C A399101 When n = 1, all vertices have a loop. When k = 1 and n is odd, the graph will have one loop.
